@startuml
title Component Diagram - Frontend requires Backend API

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

package "Frontend" <<subsystem>> {
  component "DashboardPage\nConfigPage\nHistoryPage" as Pages <<component>>
  component "AuthProvider" as AuthProvider <<component>>
  component "API Client\nfrontend/src/api" as ApiClient <<component>>
}

package "Backend API" <<subsystem>> {
  component "AuthController" as AuthController <<component>>
  component "DashboardController" as DashboardController <<component>>
  component "ControlController" as ControlController <<component>>
  component "ConfigController" as ConfigController <<component>>
}

interface "IAuthAPI" as IAuth
interface "IDashboardAPI" as IDashboard
interface "IControlAPI" as IControl
interface "IConfigAPI" as IConfig

Pages --> ApiClient : uses
AuthProvider --> ApiClient : token/session

ApiClient ..> IAuth : required socket\nHTTP REST
ApiClient ..> IDashboard : required socket\nHTTP REST / SSE
ApiClient ..> IControl : required socket\nHTTP REST
ApiClient ..> IConfig : required socket\nHTTP REST

IAuth - AuthController : provided lollipop
IDashboard - DashboardController : provided lollipop
IControl - ControlController : provided lollipop
IConfig - ConfigController : provided lollipop

note bottom of ApiClient
Port: HTTP client
Source: frontend/src/api/apiClient.js
end note

@enduml
